                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The clerk signs\nthe last line\nafter you name the\ncheck. Every stop",
                                  "has a duty and a\nway to ask for\nhelp. Pip holds\nthe packet like a",
                                  "trophy until Dot\nasks him not to\nbend the corners.\nHe carries it",
                                  "flat the rest of\nthe way."
